14r3|n|A syllable applied to the sixth tone of the scale in music in solmization. ; The tone A; -- so called among the French and Italians. ; Look; see; behold; -- sometimes followed by you. ; An exclamation of surprise; -- commonly followed by me; as, La me!	n:1nhe,128,5;14r3,101,5~1nhe,128,5;14r3,101,5	N:rdp,149,4;ayc,140,14;27aw,120,2;14r3,101,5;1ndq,87,6;22d8,38,3~ayc,140,14;1ndq,87,6;14r3,101,5;rdp,149,4;22d8,38,3;27aw,120,2
